{
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-alexUnderneath1-11706": "????: 有人吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-alexUnderneath1-11707": "JUNA: 亚历？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-alexUnderneath1-11708": "ALEXANDRA: 你们在哪儿？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-alexUnderneath1-11709": "JUNA: 上面。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-alexUnderneath1-11710": "ALEXANDRA: 太好了！我逃出了梦境，还以为只剩自己。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-alexUnderneath1-11711": "JUNA: 你在哪儿？能过来吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-alexUnderneath1-11712": "ALEXANDRA: 在一个很窄的地方，像是……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-alexUnderneath1-11713": "ALEXANDRA: 到处是齿轮之类的东西，可不是金属做的，是魔法。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-alexUnderneath1-11714": "ALEXANDRA: 现在看见你们了，这里也许是你们所在洞穴的外壳。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-alexUnderneath1-11715": "JUNA: 那些齿轮能修好这座桥吗？也许能找到去你那边的路。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-alexUnderneath1-11716": "ALEXANDRA: 等等。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-alexUnderneath1-11717": "JUNA: 成了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-alexUnderneath1-11718": "ALEXANDRA: 好，我也沿这边继续走。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benGluIntro-11719": "JEROME: 上面会是谁？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benGluIntro-11720": "JUNA: 大概得走近点才——",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benGluIntro-11721": "BEN: 嘿！两个人请病假，帕诺斯还直接不干了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benGluIntro-11722": "BEN: 看我干什么？进来！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benGluIntro-11723": "JUNA: 迟早都得找到他。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benGluIntro-11724": "JEROME: 至少听得懂，真好。这是不是说明齐卡隆就在附近？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benGluIntro-11725": "BEN: 麻利点！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benKitchen1-11726": "BEN: 听好了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benKitchen1-11727": "BEN: 城里最有名的美食评论家来了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benKitchen1-11728": "BEN: 偏偏是星期二。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benKitchen1-11729": "BEN: 还是八月中旬……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benKitchen1-11730": "BEN: 总之，送货的已经被我抓去洗碗了。你把柠檬蛋汤收个尾，我给羊肉摆盘。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benKitchen1-11731": "JUNA: 我？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benKitchen1-11732": "BEN: 总不能让你当迎宾吧？客人会怎么想？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benKitchen1-11733": "BEN: 就在那边台面上。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benKitchen1-11734": "BEN: 还有你，长得高高帅帅的，去前面哄哄进门的老太太，争取点时间。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benKitchen1-11735": "BEN: 动起来！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-avgoMaker-11736": "JUNA: 好，这是……汤？我从没喝过汤。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-avgoMaker-11737": "JUNA: 扔点东西进去吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-avgoMaker-11738": "JUNA: 先放……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-avgoMaker-11739": "胡萝卜",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-avgoMaker-11740": "椒类",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-avgoMaker2-11741": "JUNA: 好，接着加……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-avgoMaker2-11742": "鸡肉",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-avgoMaker2-11743": "香肠",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-avgoMaker3-11744": "JUNA: 最后……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-avgoMaker3-11745": "柠檬汁",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-avgoMaker3-11746": "橙汁",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-avgoMaker4-11747": "BEN: 好了吗？来帮我上菜。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-avgoMaker4-11748": "BEN: 麻利点！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nightmarePatron1-11749": "PATRON: 情况很糟，你自己也知道。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nightmarePatron1-11750": "PATRON: 这里的菜真难吃，附近再开一家店，就没人来这儿了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nightmarePatron2-11751": "PATRON: 这顿饭吃得我不想活了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nightmarePatron2-11752": "PATRON: 法律禁止把饭做得这么难吃，你犯了法，要进监狱。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nightmarePatron2-11753": "PATRON: 这里的厨子要是有父母，他们一定会为他羞愧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nightmarePatron3-11754": "PATRON: 在这里吃完，我再也体会不到饮食的乐趣了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nightmarePatron3-11755": "PATRON: 未来的历史学家会把这家店开张之日，视为社会衰落的开端。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nightmarePatron3-11756": "PATRON: 我来吃饭，只是可怜你们。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nightmareDishes-11757": "DISHWASHER: 噩梦里这部分可是真事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nightmareDishes-11758": "DISHWASHER: 害我后面五趟送货全迟了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nightmareCritic-11759": "FOOD CRITIC: 本·巴拉尼要是从没进过厨房，世界一定更美好。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nightmareCritic-11760": "FOOD CRITIC: 趁我的评论还没发表，赶紧装死逃出城吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nightmareCritic-11761": "FOOD CRITIC: 我没抱什么期望。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-foodCriticEncounter-11762": "BEN: 先生，您的烤羊肉……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-foodCriticEncounter-11763": "BEN: 还有柠檬蛋汤。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-foodCriticEncounter-11764": "FOOD CRITIC: 老实说，我原本就没抱多大期望。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-foodCriticEncounter-11765": "BEN: （哎哟，来了。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-foodCriticEncounter-11766": "FOOD CRITIC: 这道柠檬蛋汤？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-foodCriticEncounter-11767": "FOOD CRITIC: 乱七八糟，根本没弄清自己想做成什么样。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-foodCriticEncounter-11768": "FOOD CRITIC: 还有这羊肉，又干又没味，拿来喂野兽我都嫌丢人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-foodCriticEncounter-11769": "FOOD CRITIC: 乏味，守旧，该进历史的垃圾堆了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-foodCriticEncounter-11770": "FOOD CRITIC: 还有这羊肉，又干又没味，拿来喂野兽我都嫌丢人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-foodCriticEncounter-11771": "FOOD CRITIC: 精妙，既大胆创新，又不失熟悉的经典风味，大师的手笔。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-foodCriticEncounter-11772": "FOOD CRITIC: 可这羊肉……又干又没味，拿来喂野兽我都嫌丢人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-foodCriticEncounter-11773": "FOOD CRITIC: 虽然你餐厅里显然就养着一头。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-foodCriticEncounter-11774": "BEN: 我……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-foodCriticEncounter-11775": "BEN: 餐厅里为什么有野兽？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-foodCriticEncounter-11776": "BEN: 美食评论家为什么下午两点四十五分过来？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-foodCriticEncounter-11777": "BEN: 我内裤为什么穿反了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-foodCriticEncounter-11778": "BEN: 啊啊啊！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benGluMikelakis-11779": "BEN: 到底为什么会有这些事？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benGluMikelakis-11780": "BEN: 今天怎么能倒霉成这样？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benGluMikelakis-11781": "JUNA: 你在做噩梦。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benGluMikelakis-11782": "BEN: 这还用说！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benGluMikelakis-11783": "JUNA: 不，我是说，真的——",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benGluMikelakis-11784": "LYDIA: 本？又来了一位贵宾，副市长。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benGluMikelakis-11785": "LYDIA: 他说要“老样子”。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benGluMikelakis-11786": "BEN: 老样子！？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benGluMikelakis-11787": "BEN: 他以前就没来过！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benGluMikelakis-11788": "MIKELAKIS: 做好点，巴拉尼，不然明天就让卫生检查员过来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benGluMikelakis-11789": "BEN: 我怎么偏挑今天不吃蜜糖千层酥当早饭，真不是时候。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benGluMikelakis-11790": "BEN: 帮我把米形意面做完，我来弄肉。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benGluMikelakis-11791": "BEN: 米克拉基斯这种蠢货，多半只想吃烤肉串。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benGluMikelakis-11792": "BEN: 麻利点！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-manestra1-11793": "JUNA: 不太清楚该做什么……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-manestra1-11794": "JUNA: 哦，就是他常做的、亚历最喜欢的那道。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-manestra1-11795": "JUNA: 看看……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-manestra1-11796": "加入牛肉高汤",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-manestra1-11797": "加入番茄",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-manestra2-11798": "JUNA: 接着……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-manestra2-11799": "加入红洋葱",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-manestra2-11800": "加入胡萝卜",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-manestra3-11801": "JUNA: 最后……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-manestra3-11802": "加入多香果",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-manestra3-11803": "加入百里香",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-manestra4-11804": "JUNA: 这锅就听天由命吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-manestra4-11805": "BEN: 好，跟我来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-restoMikelakis-11806": "MIKELAKIS: 我没别的事干，就爱找普通厨师的麻烦。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-mikelakisTable-11807": "MIKELAKIS: 够慢的，巴拉尼。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-mikelakisTable-11808": "MIKELAKIS: 这不是我常点的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-mikelakisTable-11809": "BEN: 这是，呃……今日特餐，您常点的已经卖完了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-mikelakisTable-11810": "MIKELAKIS: 旋烤肉卷也能卖完？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-mikelakisTable-11811": "BEN: （谁他妈来我餐厅吃旋烤肉卷啊……？）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-mikelakisTable-11812": "MIKELAKIS: 米形意面挺好。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-mikelakisTable-11813": "MIKELAKIS: 米形意面还行，就是有点怪。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-mikelakisTable-11814": "MIKELAKIS: 可这鸡肉……像橡胶。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-mikelakisTable-11815": "MIKELAKIS: 我是说，这真的就是橡胶！这只鸡是橡胶做的，你把橡胶鸡给煮了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-mikelakisTable-11816": "BEN: 难怪怎么都煎不出焦壳。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-mikelakisTable-11817": "MIKELAKIS: 我要全面查这家店的税，连你本人也一起查，巴拉尼先生。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-mikelakisTable-11818": "BEN: （也许能关上窗，弄点煤气泄漏……）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-mikelakisTable-11819": "JEROME: 来了些非常……执着的客人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-mikelakisTable-11820": "CODRESCU: 你。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-mikelakisTable-11821": "BEN: 哦，坏了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-mikelakisTable-11822": "CODRESCU: 给我和所有手下做晚饭，马上。不然打碎你的膝盖。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-mikelakisTable-11823": "BEN: 开始有点离谱了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-mikelakisTable-11824": "JUNA: 也许该从这儿下手。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-mikelakisTable-11825": "JEROME: 嗯？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-mikelakisTable-11826": "JUNA: 我们刚才一直顺着梦境演下去，想让他醒过来，可我看这招行不通。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-mikelakisTable-11827": "JUNA: 要是把梦变得更离谱呢？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-mikelakisTable-11828": "JEROME: 哦，嗯……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-mikelakisTable-11829": "JUNA: 我一个人恐怕办不到，不过……（悄声耳语）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-mikelakisTable-11830": "JEROME: 哦，再把他们变得像他童年故事里那样……（悄声耳语）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-mikelakisTable-11831": "BEN: （接下来还能出什么事……？）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-JeromeResto-11832": "JEROME: 不知道我这样究竟能帮上多少……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeRestoBlocker-11833": "JEROME: 新来了些客人，你该和他们谈谈。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluMobX-11834": "MOBSTER: 希望你喜欢水泥鞋。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluCodrescu-11835": "CODRESCU: 我向往一个人人只吃热狗的世界，当然，得等你死后。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluOrphans-11836": "BEN: 这是什么鬼？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluOrphans-11837": "ORPHAN: 求求您，先生……我们这些可怜孤儿，正在这悲惨世界里寻找最后的一餐……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluOrphans-11838": "ORPHAN: 看见餐厅的灯光，就衣衫褴褛，一瘸一拐地赶过来了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluOrphans-11839": "ORPHAN: 求您了，先生，能不能最后喂我们这些将死的流浪儿一次？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluOrphans-11840": "BEN: 不可能是真的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluOrphans-11841": "BEN: 从来没人叫我先生。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluOrphans-11842": "BEN: 啊。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluOrphans-11843": "BEN: 我们在哪儿？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluOrphans-11844": "JUNA: 某种陷阱，或者监狱。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluOrphans-11845": "JEROME: 住在里面的东西，喜欢用噩梦迷惑我们。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluOrphans-11846": "BEN: 所以还真是噩梦。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluOrphans-11847": "BEN: （可内裤为什么还是反的，想不通。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluOrphans-11848": "JUNA: 去找其他人吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-restoGranny1-11849": "GRANNY: 亲爱的，我感觉自己只要吃上一口，马上就会过敏性休克。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-restoGranny2-11850": "GRANNY: 我要点菜单上没有的东西，再嫌弃它们。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluAgataBridge-11851": "JUNA: 不行，能跳过去的空隙太窄，我们也没法踩着那根栏杆保持平衡。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluAgataBridge-11852": "JUNA: 这回真得回去找阿伽塔了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluAgataBridge-11853": "BEN: 哦，她也陷在梦里了？这我能办。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benSnapsOut-11854": "BEN: 所以阿伽塔就在上面，魂不守舍？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benSnapsOut-11855": "JUNA: 对，我跟她说过了，没用。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benSnapsOut-11856": "JUNA: 她觉得城里有威胁，大概是某个法师。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benSnapsOut-11857": "BEN: 就这？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benSnapsOut-11858": "BEN: 看我的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benSnapsOut-11859": "BEN: 嘿！阿伽塔！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benSnapsOut-11860": "AGATA: 现在没空。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benSnapsOut-11861": "BEN: 是我，我就是那个威胁。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benSnapsOut-11862": "BEN: 城里有家大面包房，说只要我能给炉子附魔，让它一直热着，就给我一万。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benSnapsOut-11863": "BEN: 长话短说，戴着金属首饰，就别吃他们的面包。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benSnapsOut-11864": "BEN: 哦，还有，仓库里现在有场停不下来的雷暴。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benSnapsOut-11865": "AGATA: 我说过，不许在城内用魔法。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benSnapsOut-11866": "BEN: 说过。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benSnapsOut-11867": "DARIO: 别听他的，我们必须继续监视。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benSnapsOut-11868": "AGATA: 为什么这么做？我知道你不想有人受伤。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benSnapsOut-11869": "BEN: 我没真干，至少上次以后就没干过。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benSnapsOut-11870": "BEN: 不过，现在我们不在阿科斯，在魔法噩梦里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benSnapsOut-11871": "AGATA: 希纳尔石柱……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benSnapsOut-11872": "AGATA: 好像认得……可是……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benSnapsOut-11873": "AGATA: 科黛莉娅和你们在一起吗？我觉得这里是……不过想先问问她。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-benSnapsOut-11874": "JUNA: 还没有，不过我们得靠你帮忙去找她，不管她在哪儿。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluAgataCrossing-11875": "JUNA: 好了，亲爱的，到你显身手了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluAgataCrossing-11876": "AGATA: 好了。"
}
